{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Treasure of Anubis: Beyond the Treasure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure doesn\u2019t end upon finding the treasure\u2026 Just as our protagonist achieves his goal, the ground collapses beneath him, dragging him into a secret chamber buried deep underground. The place begins to crumble and time is running out: there\u2019s only one way out, and escaping will be harder than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and exclusive levels, not present in the main version of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and exclusive puzzles, designed only for this experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack, accompanying the tension and mystery in every chamber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 13 languages, so you can enjoy the adventure without barriers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end, your performance will be ranked as: Slave, Pawn, Priest, or Pharaoh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape alive and prove your true worth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052740?t=1759292418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052740?t=1759292418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052740/a06e54efa980ef3ce0bf2596575168a06527b8ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759292418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052740/a06e54efa980ef3ce0bf2596575168a06527b8ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759292418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":